Safe claims:
- Refers to a concrete receptacle or case connected with perfume storage.
- In some glosses it can mean the case that holds alabaster perfume flasks.

Do not infer:
- Do not assume it always names the flask itself.
- Do not treat the term as a shop noun.

### ψίαθος
